            {
                "entry_id": "31f0a291-13e3-3279-acf7-2b3f842d04ce",
                "word": "разно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                        "entry_id": "31f0a291-13e3-3279-acf7-2b3f842d04ce",
                        "glosses": [
                            "прост. не одинаково, не схоже в каком-либо отношении; по-разному"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "684dcabc-9dc4-43bd-b3fd-fb6edaee7047",
                                "sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                                "text": "Россия… это имя отзывается разно и в сердцах русских людей."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "425a69fa-3967-4a05-90ed-fb5368af6772",
                                "sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                                "text": "— Как же она баловалась? — А разно…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bc4cb21-99f1-47ff-8621-cbf4c278d0d3",
                                "sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                                "text": "— Глубоко, бесконечно жаль, что мы с тобой разно мыслим."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4f7fd726-8494-4414-8818-f527edc0855c",
                                "sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                                "text": "Люди разно одеваются и разно говорят〈…〉"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d70eb6c-228e-41b8-b0c8-dd93cac3d90b",
                                "sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                                "text": "За решёткой содержались люди разные, и стоили они разно."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "445362fb-8797-4100-bd43-a72373d56b0e",
                        "source_entry_id": "31f0a291-13e3-3279-acf7-2b3f842d04ce",
                        "source_sense_id": "06aa3dbc-1873-30b3-863c-c472402c7866",
                        "target_lang_word": "differently",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "differently",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ab40e12-70cc-3661-8d22-64232d6d1fb9",
                                        "entry_id": "9df6fc8d-c4bc-3b10-a1bf-5510eb571ae2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a different way."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e30832e-5c26-45f9-96f1-2e8831bb2696",
                                                "sense_id": "1ab40e12-70cc-3661-8d22-64232d6d1fb9",
                                                "text": "Things turned out differently from what I'd envisaged."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f437416-ee64-4582-9648-df32d445f668",
                                                "sense_id": "1ab40e12-70cc-3661-8d22-64232d6d1fb9",
                                                "text": "I was (says Mr. Highmore) forcibly struck with the violence of its pulsation, so much so, that, if it had been differently situated, I should have considered it an aneurism of considerable magnitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e633036-1ed2-4745-90e2-21f28751221f",
                                                "sense_id": "1ab40e12-70cc-3661-8d22-64232d6d1fb9",
                                                "text": "\"You see, gentlemen, I couldn't bear the look of him, there was something in him ignoble, impudent, trampling on everything sacred, something sneering and irreverent, loathsome, loathsome. But now that he's dead, I feel differently.\"\n\"How do you mean?\"\n\"I don't feel differently, but I wish I hadn't hated him so.\"\n\"You feel penitent?\"\n\"No, not penitent, don't write that. I'm not much good myself; I'm not very beautiful, so I had no right to consider him repulsive. That's what I mean. Write that down, if you like.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54171e70-6c98-4b34-89d0-6538109c7995",
                                                "sense_id": "1ab40e12-70cc-3661-8d22-64232d6d1fb9",
                                                "text": "Recent research in the field of sociolinguistics and related fields has shown that women and men speak differently."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
